Article 6

1. PPT PKBGA as referred to in Article 5 paragraph (1) letter a is established by the Regent in accordance with the Laws and Regulations.
2. Membership of PPT PKBGA as referred to in paragraph (1) consists of:
a. elements of the Regional Government;
b. vertical agencies;
c. non-governmental institutions;
d. health service institutions;
e. law enforcement officers;
f. professional personnel;
g. companion volunteers;
h. social workers;
